  ],
  "description": "ADO-EDIT conversion at assignment: on a server keyset optimistic Recordset of SELECT * FROM T ORDER BY ID (read/write copy), thirty-eight (field, value) pairs assigned to Field.Value of row 1 with the Value read back and CancelUpdate after each, with no Update (for example String \"12\", Double 12.7, Boolean, String \"1e2\", Null and Empty into Long; Long, Double, Boolean, Date, Currency and a byte array into Text; String and numbers into Date/Time; Long, String and Double into Yes/No; overflow values into Integer, Byte and Single; strings into Currency, Double and Decimal; a valid and an invalid GUID string; a String into Binary; a Long into Memo; and a Long into the AutoNumber key). Asks which assignments convert at once, which are refused at assignment and what each field reads back.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
